OL,3,GNEWSAResidents join Hollywood stars in
OL,4,AParkinson's film
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman living with Parkinson's said
OL,7,Fshe was starstruck as she featured
OL,8,Falongside Hollywood royalty in a new
OL,9,Ffilm based on the condition.
OL,11,FSue Day was an extra in the movie
OL,12,FOnwards and Sideways, which stars Laura
OL,13,FLinney and Rhys Ifans, and was filmed
OL,14,Fand set in Norfolk.
OL,16,FDay, from Hindolveston near Fakenham
OL,17,Fand whose husband also has the
OL,18,Fcondition, spoke of her nervousness at
OL,19,Fmeeting the actors, but "very soon just
OL,20,Fdeveloped a normal relationship with
OL,21,Fthem".
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
